  "worked_solution": "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255329/assets/88378ece5b1721cdc533d07d69c004901539c7f8fda9a5a3e5c5648ed32905c5.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is false since $\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\pi =1\\ne 0.$\n\n- Statement II is true. Indeed, the minimum value of the function is $-1.$\n\n- Statement III is true. The function intersects the $y$-axis at $y=1.$",
